00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,406
That is the first law of thermodynamics: energy is never lost, only moved around.

2
00:00:06,406 --> 00:00:11,953
But it does not tell us which way energy likes to flow, or why no engine can be perfect.

3
00:00:11,953 --> 00:00:15,247
That is the second law, and it is our next lesson.

4
00:00:15,247 --> 00:00:17,838
See you there, on NEBians.

